cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the public source repository and unified manuscript. Version,
  release-date, and artifact-URL fields will be added only after the designated
  immutable evidence Release has actually been published and verified.
title: >-
  Reproducible Ramsey Analysis Across Asymptotic and Finite Regimes:
  Research Software and Proof Certificates
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Xin
    given-names: Cheng
repository-code: https://github.com/jackal092927/ramsey-bounds-reproducible
abstract: >-
  Reproducible materials for a unified Ramsey manuscript containing a
  source-relative asymptotic diagonal upper bound, a source-relative
  fixed-ratio Gaussian lower-bound addition, and a proof-carrying local finite
  SAT barrier.
keywords:
  - Ramsey numbers
  - computer-assisted proof
  - interval arithmetic
  - Gaussian random graph
  - SAT
  - DRAT
